{
  "id": "poem-1107c32b8c22a2df7e42061a",
  "title": "如梦令·门外落花流水",
  "author": "谢逸",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "门外落花流水。",
    "日暖杜鹃声碎。",
    "蕃马小屏风，一枕画堂春睡。",
    "如醉。",
    "如醉。",
    "正是困人天气。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.4000.json#record-617",
